    {
      "key": "summary",
      "label": "meta description",
      "text": "This compact 992 square foot cottage features a modern farmhouse aesthetic, two bedrooms, one full bathroom, and a two-car 473 square foot garage.The home greets guests with a deep covered front porch that provides a perfect transition from the street to the welcoming interior.The open-concept layout maximizes every square inch, creating a bright and airy atmosphere that connects the living and kitchen areas seamlessly.A well-appointed kitchen includes a walk-in pantry, while the primary suite and a secondary bedroom are thoughtfully clustered for easy access to the shared full bath.Convenient main-level laundry facilities are tucked away to maintain the clean lines and efficiency of the floor plan.The striking exterior is defined by a metal roof, dark siding, and warm wood accents on the porch pillars and garage doors, offering immense curb appeal.DELIVERY NOTE: Please allow 3 to 5 business days for delivery."
    }
  ],
